flowchart TD
    Discover[Laboratory Technician discovers malfunction] --> Passport[Open asset passport and select Report Fault]
    Passport --> Form[Enter severity, failure category, and fault description]
    Form --> Submit[Submit fault report]
    Submit --> Operational{Asset is OPERATIONAL and has no active work order?}
    Operational -- No --> RejectReport[Reject report; preserve current asset state]
    Operational -- Yes --> Severity{Severity is CRITICAL?}
    Severity -- Yes --> Defective[Set asset status to DEFECTIVE]
    Severity -- No --> Maintenance[Set asset status to UNDER_MAINTENANCE]
    Defective --> Ticket[Create WO-YYYY-#### work order as OPEN]
    Maintenance --> Ticket
    Ticket --> Assign[ULMD_ADMIN assigns active MAINTENANCE_TECH]
    Assign --> Start[Assigned technician starts work; status IN_PROGRESS]
    Start --> PartsApprovalNeeded{External-parts approval requested?}
    PartsApprovalNeeded -- Yes --> RequestDetails[Enter free-text external-parts request details]
    PartsApprovalNeeded -- No --> Parts{Waiting for parts?}
    Parts -- Yes --> Waiting[Set AWAITING_PARTS]
    Waiting --> PartsRequest{Assigned technician requests external-parts approval?}
    PartsRequest -- No --> Resume[Parts available; resume IN_PROGRESS]
    PartsRequest -- Yes --> RequestDetails
    RequestDetails --> AwaitApproval[Set AWAITING_APPROVAL; preserve previous status and asset condition]
    AwaitApproval --> RequestAudit[Append immutable request audit snapshot]
    RequestAudit --> ApprovalRoles{Authorized existing role configured?}
    ApprovalRoles -- No --> Disabled[Decision endpoint disabled; request remains blocked]
    ApprovalRoles -- Yes --> Decision{Configured approver decides}
    Decision -- Approve --> ApprovalAudit[Append immutable approval decision snapshot]
    ApprovalAudit --> Restore[Restore saved previous status]
    Restore --> PriorState{Previous status}
    PriorState -- IN_PROGRESS --> Repair[Diagnose and repair instrument]
    PriorState -- AWAITING_PARTS --> Waiting
    Decision -- Reject --> RejectionAudit[Append immutable rejection decision snapshot]
    RejectionAudit --> Rejected[Record rejection; remain AWAITING_APPROVAL]
    Rejected --> RejectionPolicy[Post-rejection disposition awaits stakeholder decision]
    Parts -- No --> Repair
    Repair --> Log[Record actions, parts, labor, and approved outcome]
    Log --> Outcome{Outcome condition}
    Outcome -- OPERATIONAL --> Resolved[Set work order RESOLVED]
    Outcome -- REPAIRED_DEGRADED --> Policy[Closure behavior requires stakeholder decision]
    Outcome -- UNREPAIRABLE --> Policy
    Policy --> NonOperationalReview{Custodian requests more repair work?}
    NonOperationalReview -- Yes --> RejectRepair
    NonOperationalReview -- No --> Pending([Do not close or decommission until policy is approved])
    Resolved --> Verify{Custodian Lab Manager or ULMD_ADMIN verifies?}
    Verify -- No --> RejectRepair[Record notes; return work order to IN_PROGRESS]
    RejectRepair --> Repair
    Verify -- Yes --> Closed[Set work order CLOSED and asset OPERATIONAL]
    Closed --> Audit[Append immutable work-order and asset audit snapshots]
    Audit --> Done([Maintenance history retained])
    RejectReport --> End([No work order created])
